# UI & Component Rules

- Default to Server Components.
- Use named exports for components (except page.tsx).
- Extract props as interfaces.
- Reuse existing primitives from `src/components/ui` before creating new ones.
- Forms should be progressive disclosure (max 3–5 steps for booking/estimate).
- Phone-first layouts for public and customer surfaces.
- Admin optimized for desktop but usable on tablet.
- Clear empty states and next actions on all list pages.
- Accessibility: use semantic HTML and accessible primitives.
